+## Filtering
+
+The list has a name search and a status filter. Both are applied by the
+repository, so the grid still loads one page at a time. The filter is kept in the
+URL as the query parameters `name` and `status`, for example
+`/?name=vir&status=ACTIVE,CLOSED`, so a filtered list can be bookmarked or shared.
+Typing updates the URL with `replaceState`, so it does not add history entries.
